      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "A01",
          "source_segment_id": "6fd335ef-2030-4320-b66b-8ed2df79f72d",
          "start_ms": 160,
          "end_ms": 5960,
          "text": "就限制这个用户直播之后，基本上就只能只能停止直播。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A02",
          "source_segment_id": "c304460b-2451-4979-9e19-9b9b85824e70",
          "start_ms": 6400,
          "end_ms": 19830,
          "text": "对，然后就是，沃尔沃这个还多做了多做了一套机制，就是说后面连上来的后面连上来的 APP 只能做停止直播的一个限制，我感觉这个。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A03",
          "source_segment_id": "7eee0932-6203-4d9f-88b7-718c501342ca",
          "start_ms": 20720,
          "end_ms": 25280,
          "text": "这一套限制的实现可以直接删掉哦，你说哪哪些限制？",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A04",
          "source_segment_id": "3e943bb2-ab40-4dbd-9cef-e124215f0bb8",
          "start_ms": 25960,
          "end_ms": 26800,
          "text": "就是说。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A05",
          "source_segment_id": "83cfcdfe-b255-49bc-9e9c-8ed1d82d6d6b",
          "start_ms": 28620,
          "end_ms": 48100,
          "text": "嗯，库本身本身是不会对这个，就说你一个APP连上了，连上了设备之后，然后让它开播了，然后这个时候退出，过了10秒之后再连回来的话，那么它能执行的操作只有终止。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A06",
          "source_segment_id": "6fb30f63-fc2d-488c-abb7-4b918a7c136c",
          "start_ms": 48180,
          "end_ms": 53020,
          "text": "对呀，对呀，不是，这个是在代码实现里面有实际的限制的。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A07",
          "source_segment_id": "f70bec70-62e7-4a2a-ae69-a17eca691efc",
          "start_ms": 53220,
          "end_ms": 60260,
          "text": "但是但是我觉得这样我们已经约定好了，然后UI上也有做这种操作限制，那其实就没有必要在代码上写这个限制。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A08",
          "source_segment_id": "23424771-e034-4fcc-943e-50a1287753cd",
          "start_ms": 61740,
          "end_ms": 64020,
          "text": "也可以啊，不用给你不用不用去掉它。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A09",
          "source_segment_id": "1012cd35-66fb-4b8c-a308-d443055851b5",
          "start_ms": 64500,
          "end_ms": 69580,
          "text": "你说你说在代码上做一个限制，那协议里面写的不是我们做的限制吗？",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A10",
          "source_segment_id": "6a5c6dff-d22d-4d6d-bda0-0b5b6f88ed51",
          "start_ms": 70340,
          "end_ms": 74500,
          "text": "对啊，我意思说协议里面有了限制，然后在UI层面又不可能到达。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A11",
          "source_segment_id": "af6cb002-e02d-4a95-83ba-796b718630c6",
          "start_ms": 74970,
          "end_ms": 78290,
          "text": "就不可能到达，就是说重新连完了之后又重新配网。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A12",
          "source_segment_id": "d3047b71-1da8-466d-95d6-b8636e82c028",
          "start_ms": 78450,
          "end_ms": 79250,
          "text": "嗯，是的。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A13",
          "source_segment_id": "0f74e38a-33c1-4180-947c-4f0938abb9e2",
          "start_ms": 79370,
          "end_ms": 81130,
          "text": "那其实代码里面不需要写死。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A14",
          "source_segment_id": "731e4188-7cae-44ba-b970-66b41da967df",
          "start_ms": 81290,
          "end_ms": 81890,
          "text": "对对对。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A15",
          "source_segment_id": "54c5ce48-2131-4014-976d-7c0268f3fb6a",
          "start_ms": 82170,
          "end_ms": 82610,
          "text": "对，因为。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A16",
          "source_segment_id": "c8ccaf94-d3f9-419d-8f84-a0dd36338749",
          "start_ms": 82650,
          "end_ms": 89210,
          "text": "因为那个那个无，不可能到达的，你去做做阻挡，你根本阻挡一个不存在的东西嘛。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A17",
          "source_segment_id": "ebd28f2d-7936-465c-8a66-1da409ffbc4a",
          "start_ms": 89250,
          "end_ms": 91170,
          "text": "对，是啊，所以我说把这个也删。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "A18",
          "source_segment_id": "eb477116-10f0-4749-b588-dc45c8dc8979",
          "start_ms": 91410,
          "end_ms": 91970,
          "text": "对。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "video",
      "record_id": "edefb542-e50a-4851-964e-2682961939be",
