      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "V01",
          "source_segment_id": "fdf314af-92f1-461d-a91c-5e781eb31da1",
          "start_ms": 320,
          "end_ms": 6040,
          "text": "中国大部分老板都不是资本家思维，而是封建地主奴隶主思维。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 11
        },
        {
          "id": "V02",
          "source_segment_id": "04632f21-e32a-433e-8405-379bda18ee3c",
          "start_ms": 6680,
          "end_ms": 12760,
          "text": "资本家思维是你只要给他挣到钱，你怎么都可以，你不来上班也没问题。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "V03",
          "source_segment_id": "d267e3dd-bc00-498e-b290-ca9394d209f4",
          "start_ms": 12880,
          "end_ms": 14680,
          "text": "对，那么奴隶主思维呢？",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "V04",
          "source_segment_id": "ddaaef9f-13f7-4646-8953-187b693eb871",
          "start_ms": 15120,
          "end_ms": 26200,
          "text": "他就是看不得你闲，他在全方位监控你，就跟你签了卖身契卖给他一样，只要你闲着，他就觉得你工作没做完，你在偷懒。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "V05",
          "source_segment_id": "ce0752bc-59c4-4acc-8cfe-c6d35d8b445f",
          "start_ms": 26460,
          "end_ms": 30540,
          "text": "他绝对不会因为你的能力强，把工作提前做完而高兴。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "V06",
          "source_segment_id": "89248ee5-829d-4efa-ad2e-d900375aaa69",
          "start_ms": 30900,
          "end_ms": 34220,
          "text": "他看见你下班早，比他亏钱还难受。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "V07",
          "source_segment_id": "1aa55a20-8145-40b2-bab9-5d3477648a74",
          "start_ms": 34740,
          "end_ms": 43420,
          "text": "两者之间最大的区别就是，资本家觉得你是在帮他赚钱，奴隶主觉得你是在挣他的钱。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "V08",
          "source_segment_id": "977e929b-f496-44e2-8680-dedd214652f9",
          "start_ms": 44820,
          "end_ms": 47340,
          "text": "来抖音极速版看视频领现金。",
          "revision": 1,
          "correction_revision": 0
        }
      ]
    }
